# Wanted (IDEAS I22, I25 c; QUESTIONS Q29, 1; board 0.3). Fails until it is answered; then it moves up into collab/scenarios.
# Story: a newcomer learns Arbor's keys in a minute: nine, each ⌃⌥ and one key. Two windows side by side, one fills the screen,
# the same key brings the two back. No key with a third modifier, no digit, no other letter is taken from the apps.
open Safari
open Notes
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+left on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+right on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+return on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+space on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+[ on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+z on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+f on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+g on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+escape on
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+cmd+left off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+shift+left off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+up off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+down off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+1 off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+shift+1 off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+shift+z off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+d off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+m off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+n off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+r off
expect shortcut ctrl+opt+0 off
focus 101
key ctrl+opt+left
expect docked 101
focus 102
key ctrl+opt+right
expect docked 102
expect left-of 101 102
key ctrl+opt+return
expect fills 102
key ctrl+opt+return
expect visible 101
expect visible 102
key ctrl+opt+z
key ctrl+opt+f
expect floating 102
